\,\\frac{3{e}^{(2t+1)}}{2}⟩+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-99378" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,{e}^{2t}⟩+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-50201" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $\\int ⟨\\frac{3}{t},\\frac{5}{{t}^{2}}⟩\\text{d}t.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-50201" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\frac{3}{t},\\,\\frac{5}{{t}^{2}}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int \\frac{3}{t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int \\frac{5}{{t}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|+{c}_{1},\\,-\\frac{5}{t}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|,\\,-\\frac{5}{t}⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|,\\,-\\frac{5}{t}⟩+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-50201" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "04eca659e09dc9a77301cd7af598024ca582eee954e6337d97e460da43fbcc92" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-50201" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-123437" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $\\int ⟨{e}^{t},\\,10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩\\,\\text{d}t.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-123437" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨{e}^{t},\\,10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩\\text{d}t=⟨\\int {e}^{t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int 10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\,\\text{d}t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $x(t)={e}^{t},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int {e}^{t}\\text{d}t={e}^{t}+{c}_{1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $y(t)=10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6}),$ we calculate its integral using substitution. So, we let $u=2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}t}=2\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}t=\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,  we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int y(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =\\int 10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\int 10\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{10}{2}\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =5(\\operatorname{sin}⁡u)+{c}_{2} \\\\  & =5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})+{c}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨{e}^{t},\\,10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨{e}^{t}+{c}_{1},\\,5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{e}^{t},\\,5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{e}^{t},\\,5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-123437" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "04eca659e09dc9a77301cd7af598024ca582eee954e6337d97e460da43fbcc92" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-123437" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-123437" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨{e}^{5t},\\,5\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t-\\frac{\\pi }{2})⟩+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-123437" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨{e}^{t-1},\\,5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-123437" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨{e}^{t-1},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-123437" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨{e}^{t},\\,5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)⟩+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-123437" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨{e}^{t},\\,5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-123437" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨{e}^{t},\\,5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-123474" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨\\frac{16\\sqrt[3]{t}}{3},\\,5{e}^{5t}⟩$ and $F(0)=⟨2,\\,-1⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-123474" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨\\frac{16\\sqrt[3]{t}}{3},\\,5{e}^{5t}⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\frac{16\\sqrt[3]{t}}{3},\\,5{e}^{5t}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int \\frac{16\\sqrt[3]{t}}{3}\\,\\text{d}t,\\int 5{e}^{5t}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨4{t}^{4/3}+{c}_{1},\\,{e}^{5t}+{c}_{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe initial condition $F(0)=⟨2,\\,-1⟩$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(0)=⟨4\\cdot {0}^{4/3}+{c}_{1},\\,{e}^{5\\cdot 0}+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨2,\\,-1⟩ \\\\ ⟨{c}_{1},\\,1+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨2,\\,-1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${c}_{1}=2$ and ${c}_{2}=-2.$ Consequently\n\n$$\nF(t)=⟨4{t}^{4/3}+2,\\,{e}^{5t}-2⟩.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-123474" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "04eca659e09dc9a77301cd7af598024ca582eee954e6337d97e460da43fbcc92" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-123474" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-123474" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨4{t}^{1/3}+1,\\,{e}^{t}-1⟩"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-123474" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨4{t}^{4/3}+2,\\,5{e}^{5t}-1⟩"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-123474" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨4{t}^{4/3}+2,\\,{e}^{5t}-2⟩"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-123474" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨4{t}^{4/3}-2,\\,{e}^{5t}-2⟩"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-123474" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨{t}^{4/3}+2,\\,{e}^{2t}-5⟩"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-123474" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨4{t}^{4/3}+2,\\,{e}^{5t}-2⟩"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "de02ce81f152dc8fafd99f978fee626a5175a8933452b2bface34d3c9e8a8d46" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "e-612" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $\\mathbf F(t)$ given that $\\mathbf F'(t)= \\langle 6t^5+2t, \\sec^2 t\\rangle.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/example-612.json" "file_sha256" "756a84fac8544de6073a5e0a69586616380f4c7c2b860b805325d67032294e30" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "e-612" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Note that \n\n$$\n\\mathbf F(t)=\\int \\mathbf F'(t)\\, \\textrm d t=\\int \\left\\langle 6t^5+2t,\\, \\sec^2 t\\right\\rangle \\, \\textrm d t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨6{t}^{5}+2t,\\,{sec}^{2}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int (6{t}^{5}+2t)\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int {sec}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{6}+{t}^{2}+{c}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{tan}⁡t+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{6}+{t}^{2},\\,\\operatorname{tan}⁡t⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{6}+{t}^{2},\\,\\operatorname{tan}⁡t⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $\\mathbf C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/example-612.json" "file_sha256" "756a84fac8544de6073a5e0a69586616380f4c7c2b860b805325d67032294e30" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "e-613" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\displaystyle \\int \\left\\langle\\cos(2t+1), \\, 4\\right\\rangle \\,\\textrm d t\\,.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/example-613.json" "file_sha256" "f7b9c97f25f78fb43d2267d607cb9a71c12fcfe325eccdf5b3b7502549eca41e" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "e-613" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t+1),\\,4⟩\\,\\text{d}t=⟨\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t+1)\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int 4\\,\\text{d}t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $x(t) =\\cos(2t+1),$ we calculate its integral using substitution. So, we let $u= 2t +1.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d u}{\\textrm d t} = 2\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\textrm d t = \\dfrac 1 2 \\textrm d u.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t+1)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡u)+{c}_{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t+1)+{c}_{1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $y(t) =4,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int y(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int 4\\text{d}t=4t+{c}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t+1),\\,4⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t+1)+{c}_{1},\\,4t+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t+1),\\,4t⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t+1),\\,4t⟩+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/example-613.json" "file_sha256" "f7b9c97f25f78fb43d2267d607cb9a71c12fcfe325eccdf5b3b7502549eca41e" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "e-614" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate $\\displaystyle \\int_0^{2} \\left\\langle 2e^{t},\\, 6t^2\\right\\rangle\\, \\textrm d t.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/example-614.json" "file_sha256" "96f51f7f38fe88727c905081baabaadc2f9034c6afa8e8e61fb39805f381196d" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "e-614" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}⟨2{e}^{t},\\,6{t}^{2}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{0}^{2}2{e}^{t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,{\\int }_{0}^{2}6{t}^{2}\\,\\text{d}t⟩. \\\\  & =⟨2{e}^{t}\\,\\,{|}_{0}^{2},\\,2{t}^{3}\\,\\,{|}_{0}^{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨[2{e}^{2}-2{e}^{0}],\\,[2\\cdot {2}^{3}-0]⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2{e}^{2}-2,\\,16⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/example-614.json" "file_sha256" "96f51f7f38fe88727c905081baabaadc2f9034c6afa8e8e61fb39805f381196d" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "e-615" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\mathbf F(t)$ given that $\\mathbf F'(t)= \\left\\langle \\sec t \\tan t, \\,  \\sin(2t)\\right\\rangle$ and $\\mathbf F(0)=\\langle 0,\\, 0\\rangle.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/example-615.json" "file_sha256" "d20b293111cbac091c31683dcc52114e4ea9fb8f1336f3e8df1883ee0a406644" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "e-615" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Note that \n\n$$\n\\mathbf F(t)=\\int \\mathbf F'(t)\\, \\textrm d t=\\int \\left\\langle \\sec t \\tan t,\\,  \\sin(2t)\\right\\rangle \\, \\textrm d t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int \\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t,\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t+{c}_{1},\\,-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t)+{c}_{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe initial condition $\\mathbf F(0)=\\left\\langle 0,\\, 0 \\right\\rangle$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(0)=⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡0+{c}_{1},\\,-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\cdot 0)+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨0,\\,0⟩ \\\\ ⟨1+{c}_{1},\\,-\\frac{1}{2}+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨0,\\,0⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $c_1=-1$ and $c_2=\\dfrac 12.$ Consequently, \n\n$$\n\\mathbf F(t)=\\left\\langle  \\sec t - 1  , \\,  -\\dfrac 1 2\\cos(2t)+ \\dfrac12\\right\\rangle.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/example-615.json" "file_sha256" "d20b293111cbac091c31683dcc52114e4ea9fb8f1336f3e8df1883ee0a406644" "basis" 1821 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/edb-import/verification.json"}] "sources" [{"question" "q-80463" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨{csc}^{2}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-80463" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨{csc}^{2}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨{csc}^{2}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int {csc}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t,\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t+{c}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-80463" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bdcfd3150b35cb7cc7b5552384b12541fb2d22fdecd3bb553e112506bafed2c4"} {"question" "q-80463" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-80463" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-80463" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123292" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨{e}^{2t}+5,\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t+1)⟩$, then $F(t)=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123292" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨{e}^{2t}+5,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨{e}^{2t}+5,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t+1)⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int ({e}^{2t}+5)\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(t+1)\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{2}+5t+{c}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t+1)+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{2}+5t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t+1)⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{2}+5t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t+1)⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123292" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bdcfd3150b35cb7cc7b5552384b12541fb2d22fdecd3bb553e112506bafed2c4"} {"question" "q-123292" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123292" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{2}+5t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t+1)⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{2}+5t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{2},\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t+1)⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{5t},\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t+1)⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\frac{{e}^{t}}{2}+5,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t+1)⟩+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123292" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{2}+5t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t+1)⟩+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99253" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨4{t}^{3}-1,\\,2{e}^{t}⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99253" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨4{t}^{3}-1,\\,2{e}^{t}⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨4{t}^{3}-1,\\,2{e}^{t}⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int (4{t}^{3}-1)\\,\\text{d}t,2\\int {e}^{t}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4}-t+{c}_{1},\\,2{e}^{t}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4}-t,\\,2{e}^{t}⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4}-t,\\,2{e}^{t}⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99253" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bdcfd3150b35cb7cc7b5552384b12541fb2d22fdecd3bb553e112506bafed2c4"} {"question" "q-99253" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99253" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨3{t}^{4}-2t,\\,\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{2t}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨4{t}^{2}-t,2{e}^{2t}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{t}^{3}-1,\\,2{e}^{t}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{t}^{4}-t,\\,2{e}^{t}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{t}^{4}-t,{e}^{2t}⟩+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99253" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨{t}^{4}-t,\\,2{e}^{t}⟩+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123294" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨4{t}^{3}+2,\\,\\frac{t}{4}⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123294" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨4{t}^{3}+2,\\,\\frac{t}{4}⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨4{t}^{3}+2,\\,\\frac{t}{4}⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int (4{t}^{3}+2)\\,\\text{d}t,\\int \\frac{t}{4}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4}+2t+{c}_{1},\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{8}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4}+2t,\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{8}⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4}+2t,\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{8}⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123294" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bdcfd3150b35cb7cc7b5552384b12541fb2d22fdecd3bb553e112506bafed2c4"} {"question" "q-123294" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123294" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨2{t}^{4}+2,\\,\\frac{t}{8}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨t+4,\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{8}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{t}^{2}-4t,\\,\\frac{t}{8}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{t}^{4}+2t,\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{4}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{t}^{4}+2t,\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{8}⟩+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123294" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨{t}^{4}+2t,\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{8}⟩+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99260" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨{sec}^{2}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99260" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨{sec}^{2}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨{sec}^{2}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int {sec}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t,\\int (-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{tan}⁡t+{c}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99260" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bdcfd3150b35cb7cc7b5552384b12541fb2d22fdecd3bb553e112506bafed2c4"} {"question" "q-99260" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99260" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{cot}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99260" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-50201" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $\\int ⟨\\frac{3}{t},\\frac{5}{{t}^{2}}⟩\\text{d}t.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-50201" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\frac{3}{t},\\,\\frac{5}{{t}^{2}}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int \\frac{3}{t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int \\frac{5}{{t}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|+{c}_{1},\\,-\\frac{5}{t}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|,\\,-\\frac{5}{t}⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|,\\,-\\frac{5}{t}⟩+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-50201" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bdcfd3150b35cb7cc7b5552384b12541fb2d22fdecd3bb553e112506bafed2c4"} {"question" "q-50201" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-50201" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-⟨3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|,\\,\\frac{5}{t}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|,\\,-\\frac{5}{t}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|,\\,\\frac{5}{t}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|,\\,-\\frac{5}{t}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|,\\,\\frac{1}{t}⟩+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-50201" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|,\\,-\\frac{5}{t}⟩+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123437" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $\\int ⟨{e}^{t},\\,10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩\\,\\text{d}t.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123437" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨{e}^{t},\\,10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩\\text{d}t=⟨\\int {e}^{t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int 10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\,\\text{d}t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $x(t)={e}^{t},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int {e}^{t}\\text{d}t={e}^{t}+{c}_{1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $y(t)=10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6}),$ we calculate its integral using substitution. So, we let $u=2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}t}=2\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}t=\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,  we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int y(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =\\int 10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\int 10\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{10}{2}\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =5(\\operatorname{sin}⁡u)+{c}_{2} \\\\  & =5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})+{c}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨{e}^{t},\\,10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨{e}^{t}+{c}_{1},\\,5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{e}^{t},\\,5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{e}^{t},\\,5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123437" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bdcfd3150b35cb7cc7b5552384b12541fb2d22fdecd3bb553e112506bafed2c4"} {"question" "q-123437" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123437" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨{e}^{5t},\\,5\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t-\\frac{\\pi }{2})⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{e}^{t-1},\\,5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{e}^{t-1},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{e}^{t},\\,5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{e}^{t},\\,5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123437" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨{e}^{t},\\,5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99378" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $\\int ⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,3{e}^{(2t+1)}⟩\\,\\text{d}t.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99378" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,2{e}^{(2t+1)}⟩\\,\\text{d}t=⟨\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int 2{e}^{(2t+1)}\\,\\text{d}t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $x(t)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t=\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+{c}_{1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $y(t)=2{e}^{(2t+1)},$ we calculate its integral using substitution. So, we let $u=2t+1.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}t}=2\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}t=\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,  we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int y(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =\\int 2{e}^{(2t+1)}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\int 3{e}^{u}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}\\int {e}^{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}{e}^{u}+{c}_{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{3{e}^{(2t+1)}}{2}+{c}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,3{e}^{(2t+1)}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+{c}_{1},\\,\\frac{3{e}^{(2t+1)}}{2}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,\\frac{3{e}^{(2t+1)}}{2}⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,\\frac{3{e}^{(2t+1)}}{2}⟩+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99378" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bdcfd3150b35cb7cc7b5552384b12541fb2d22fdecd3bb553e112506bafed2c4"} {"question" "q-99378" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99378" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,\\frac{3{e}^{(2t+1)}}{2}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,{e}^{(2t+1)}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,\\frac{({e}^{2t}+e)}{2}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,\\frac{3{e}^{(2t+1)}}{2}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,{e}^{2t}⟩+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99378" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,\\frac{3{e}^{(2t+1)}}{2}⟩+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-50204" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $\\int ⟨{e}^{t},\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-50204" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨{e}^{t},\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int {e}^{t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{e}^{t}+{c}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{e}^{t},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{e}^{t},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-50204" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bdcfd3150b35cb7cc7b5552384b12541fb2d22fdecd3bb553e112506bafed2c4"} {"question" "q-50204" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-50204" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨2{e}^{2t},\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨2{e}^{t},\\,-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{t},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{e}^{t},\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{e}^{t},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-50204" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨{e}^{t},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f