"question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bdcfd3150b35cb7cc7b5552384b12541fb2d22fdecd3bb553e112506bafed2c4"} {"question" "q-123517" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123517" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨1-\\frac{1}{{e}^{3}},\\,280⟩"] ["math" "⟨1-\\frac{1}{{e}^{6}},\\,288⟩"] ["math" "⟨1-{e}^{3},\\,108⟩"] ["math" "⟨6+\\frac{1}{e},\\,228⟩"] ["math" "⟨\\frac{1}{{e}^{6}},\\,128⟩"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123517" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨1-\\frac{1}{{e}^{6}},\\,288⟩"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349147" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate the following integral of a vector-valued function. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{4}⟨{t}^{2}-2t,\\,3{t}^{3}+t⟩\\,\\text{d}t=⟨$\n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}} $⟩$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349147" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{4}⟨{t}^{2}-2t,\\,3{t}^{3}+t⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{0}^{4}({t}^{2}-2t)\\,\\text{d}t,\\,{\\int }_{0}^{4}(3{t}^{3}+t)\\,\\text{d}t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor the first component,\n\n$$\n\\int ({t}^{2}-2t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\frac{1}{3}{t}^{3}-{t}^{2}.\n$$\n\nFor the second component,\n\n$$\n\\int (3{t}^{3}+t)\\,\\text{d}t=3\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}{t}^{4}+\\frac{1}{2}{t}^{2}=\\frac{3}{4}{t}^{4}+\\frac{1}{2}{t}^{2}.\n$$\n\nThus,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{4}⟨{t}^{2}-2t,\\,3{t}^{3}+t⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨(\\frac{1}{3}{t}^{3}-{t}^{2}){|}_{0}^{4},\\,(\\frac{3}{4}{t}^{4}+\\frac{1}{2}{t}^{2}){|}_{0}^{4}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(\\frac{1}{3}(64)-16)-0,\\,(\\frac{3}{4}(256)+\\frac{1}{2}(16))-0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(\\frac{64}{3}-16),\\,(192+8)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{16}{3},\\,200⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{16}{3},\\,200⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349147" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bdcfd3150b35cb7cc7b5552384b12541fb2d22fdecd3bb553e112506bafed2c4"} {"question" "q-349147" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349147" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{16}{3}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349147" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349147" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "200"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123456" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "${\\int }_{4}^{9}⟨4-2t,\\,\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{t}}⟩\\text{d}t=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123456" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{4}^{9}⟨4-2t,\\,\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{t}}⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{4}^{9}4-2t\\,\\text{d}t,{\\int }_{4}^{9}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{t}}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(4t-{t}^{2})\\,\\,{|}_{4}^{9},\\,2\\sqrt{t}\\,\\,{|}_{4}^{9}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-45-0,\\,6-4⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-45,\\,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123456" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bdcfd3150b35cb7cc7b5552384b12541fb2d22fdecd3bb553e112506bafed2c4"} {"question" "q-123456" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123456" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨-25,\\,4⟩"] ["math" "⟨-45,\\,2⟩"] ["math" "⟨-64,\\,2⟩"] ["math" "⟨-81,\\,4⟩"] ["math" "⟨-9,\\,4⟩"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123456" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨-45,\\,2⟩"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349116" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate the following integral of a vector-valued function. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{4}^{16}⟨6t-1,\\,\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}}⟩\\,\\text{d}t=⟨$\n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}} $⟩$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349116" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{4}^{16}⟨6t-1,\\,\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{4}^{16}(6t-1)\\,\\text{d}t,\\,{\\int }_{4}^{16}\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}}\\,\\text{d}t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor the first component,\n\n$$\n\\int (6t-1)\\,\\text{d}t=3{t}^{2}-t.\n$$\n\nFor the second component,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}}\\,\\text{d}t=\\sqrt{t}.\n$$\n\nThus,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{4}^{16}⟨6t-1,\\,\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨(3{t}^{2}-t){|}_{4}^{16},\\,(\\sqrt{t}){|}_{4}^{16}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(3\\cdot {16}^{2}-16)-(3\\cdot {4}^{2}-4),\\,4-2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(768-16)-(48-4),\\,2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨752-44,\\,2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨708,\\,2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨708,\\,2⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349116" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bdcfd3150b35cb7cc7b5552384b12541fb2d22fdecd3bb553e112506bafed2c4"} {"question" "q-349116" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349116" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "708"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349116" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349116" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "2"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349112" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate the following integral of a vector-valued function. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}⟨\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡t}{3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t},\\,-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t=⟨$\n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}} $⟩$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349112" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}⟨\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡t}{3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t},\\,-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡t}{3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor the first component, let $u=3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t$, so $\\text{d}u={csc}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡t}{3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t}\\,\\text{d}t & =\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor the second component, we integrate directly:\n\n$$\n\\int -2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\n$$\n\nThus,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}⟨\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡t}{3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t},\\,-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t){|}_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2},\\,2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t{|}_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2),\\,2\\,(0-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨ln\\,(\\frac{3}{2}),\\,-\\sqrt{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨ln\\,(\\frac{3}{2}),\\,-\\sqrt{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349112" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bdcfd3150b35cb7cc7b5552384b12541fb2d22fdecd3bb553e112506bafed2c4"} {"question" "q-349112" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349112" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\ln(3)-\\ln(2)"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349112" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349112" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\sqrt{2}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349183" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $F(t)$ given that \n\n$$\n{F}^{′}(t)=⟨\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{t}}\\,,4{e}^{-2t}⟩\n$$\n\n and $F(1)=⟨11,\\,-2{e}^{-2}+3⟩.$\n\n$F(t)=⟨${{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}}$⟩$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349183" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{t}}\\,,4{e}^{-2t}⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{t}}\\,,4{e}^{-2t}⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{t}}\\,\\text{d}t,\\int 4{e}^{-2t}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨6\\sqrt{t}+{c}_{1},\\,-2{e}^{-2t}+{c}_{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe initial condition $F(1)=⟨11,\\,-2{e}^{-2}+3⟩$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(1)=⟨6\\sqrt{1}+{c}_{1},\\,-2{e}^{-2}+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨11,\\,-2{e}^{-2}+3⟩ \\\\ ⟨6+{c}_{1},\\,-2{e}^{-2}+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨11,\\,-2{e}^{-2}+3⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${c}_{1}=5$ and ${c}_{2}=3.$ Consequently\n\n$$\nF(t)=⟨6\\sqrt{t}+5,\\,-2{e}^{-2t}+3⟩.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349183" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bdcfd3150b35cb7cc7b5552384b12541fb2d22fdecd3bb553e112506bafed2c4"} {"question" "q-349183" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349183" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "6\\sqrt{t}+5"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349183" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349183" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-2e^{-2t}+3"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99517" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨3(t-1)^{2},4\\,{t}^{3}-1⟩$ and $F(1)=⟨1,\\,1⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99517" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨3(t-1)^{2},\\,4{t}^{3}-1⟩\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨3(t-1)^{2},\\,4{t}^{3}-1⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int 3(t-1)^{2}\\,\\text{d}t,\\int (4{t}^{3}-1)\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{(t-1)}^{3}+{c}_{1},\\,{t}^{4}-t+{c}_{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nThe initial condition $F(1)=⟨1,\\,1⟩$ gives \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(1)=⟨{((1)-1)}^{3}+{c}_{1},\\,(1)^{4}-(1)+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨1,\\,1⟩ \\\\ ⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨1,\\,1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${c}_{1}=1$ and ${c}_{2}=1.$ Consequently\n\n$$\nF(t)=⟨{(t-1)}^{3}+1,\\,{t}^{4}-t+1⟩.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99517" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bdcfd3150b35cb7cc7b5552384b12541fb2d22fdecd3bb553e112506bafed2c4"} {"question" "q-99517" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99517" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨{(t-1)}^{3}+1,\\,\\frac{{t}^{5}}{5}-1⟩"] ["math" "⟨{(t-1)}^{3}+1,\\,{t}^{4}-t+1⟩"] ["math" "⟨{(t-1)}^{4}+1,\\,\\frac{{t}^{4}}{4}-4⟩"] ["math" "⟨{t}^{3}+1,\\,{t}^{4}-t+1⟩"] ["math" "⟨{t}^{3}+2,\\,{t}^{4}{-}^{2}⟩"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99517" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨{(t-1)}^{3}+1,\\,{t}^{4}-t+1⟩"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99546" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨\\frac{1}{t},\\,\\pi \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)⟩$ and $F(1)=⟨-1,\\,2⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99546" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨\\frac{1}{t},\\,\\pi \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\frac{1}{t},\\,\\pi \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int \\frac{1}{t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int \\pi \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|+{c}_{1},\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)+{c}_{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe initial condition $F(1)=⟨-1,\\,2⟩$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(1)=⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡|1|+{c}_{1},\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi )+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨-1,\\,2⟩ \\\\ ⟨{c}_{1},\\,1+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨-1,\\,2⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${c}_{1}=-1$ and ${c}_{2}=1.$ Consequently\n\n$$\nF(t)=⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|-1,\\,1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)⟩.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99546" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bdcfd3150b35cb7cc7b5552384b12541fb2d22fdecd3bb553e112506bafed2c4"} {"question" "q-99546" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99546" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}+1,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)+2⟩"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡|1-t|,\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)+2⟩"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|+1,\\,1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)⟩"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|-1,\\,-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)+2⟩"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|-1,\\,1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)⟩"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-99546" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|-1,\\,1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)⟩"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123474" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨\\frac{16\\sqrt[3]{t}}{3},\\,5{e}^{5t}⟩$ and $F(0)=⟨2,\\,-1⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123474" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨\\frac{16\\sqrt[3]{t}}{3},\\,5{e}^{5t}⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\frac{16\\sqrt[3]{t}}{3},\\,5{e}^{5t}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int \\frac{16\\sqrt[3]{t}}{3}\\,\\text{d}t,\\int 5{e}^{5t}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨4{t}^{4/3}+{c}_{1},\\,{e}^{5t}+{c}_{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe initial condition $F(0)=⟨2,\\,-1⟩$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(0)=⟨4\\cdot {0}^{4/3}+{c}_{1},\\,{e}^{5\\cdot 0}+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨2,\\,-1⟩ \\\\ ⟨{c}_{1},\\,1+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨2,\\,-1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${c}_{1}=2$ and ${c}_{2}=-2.$ Consequently\n\n$$\nF(t)=⟨4{t}^{4/3}+2,\\,{e}^{5t}-2⟩.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123474" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bdcfd3150b35cb7cc7b5552384b12541fb2d22fdecd3bb553e112506bafed2c4"} {"question" "q-123474" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123474" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨4{t}^{1/3}+1,\\,{e}^{t}-1⟩"] ["math" "⟨4{t}^{4/3}+2,\\,5{e}^{5t}-1⟩"] ["math" "⟨4{t}^{4/3}+2,\\,{e}^{5t}-2⟩"] ["math" "⟨4{t}^{4/3}-2,\\,{e}^{5t}-2⟩"] ["math" "⟨{t}^{4/3}+2,\\,{e}^{2t}-5⟩"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-123474" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨4{t}^{4/3}+2,\\,{e}^{5t}-2⟩"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349193" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $F(t)$ given that \n\n$$\n{F}^{′}(t)=⟨-\\frac{4}{{t}^{3/2}}\\,,\\frac{4}{t+1}⟩\n$$\n\n and $F(1)=⟨2,\\,4\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2)⟩.$\n\n$F(t)=⟨${{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}}$⟩$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349193" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨-\\frac{4}{{t}^{3/2}}\\,,\\frac{4}{t+1}⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨-\\frac{4}{{t}^{3/2}}\\,,\\frac{4}{t+1}⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int -\\frac{4}{{t}^{3/2}}\\,\\text{d}t,\\int \\frac{4}{t+1}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{t}}+{c}_{1},\\,4\\operatorname{ln}⁡(t+1)+{c}_{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe initial condition $F(1)=⟨2,\\,4\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2)⟩$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(1)=⟨\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{1}}+{c}_{1},\\,4\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2)+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨2,\\,4\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2)⟩ \\\\ ⟨8+{c}_{1},\\,4\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2)+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨2,\\,4\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2)⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${c}_{1}=-6$ and ${c}_{2}=0.$ Consequently\n\n$$\nF(t)=⟨\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{t}}-6,\\,4\\operatorname{ln}⁡(t+1)⟩.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349193" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bdcfd3150b35cb7cc7b5552384b12541fb2d22fdecd3bb553e112506bafed2c4"} {"question" "q-349193" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349193" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{t}}-6"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349193" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "q-349193" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "4\\ln(t+1)"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/state.json" "file_sha256" "9431e364b553f24852992f7ad4b4a403e7afc2cd51be1cfdb889f855d13f201a"} {"question" "e-612" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $\\mathbf F(t)$ given that $\\mathbf F'(t)= \\langle 6t^5+2t, \\sec^2 t\\rangle.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/example-612.json" "file_sha256" "756a84fac8544de6073a5e0a69586616380f4c7c2b860b805325d67032294e30"} {"question" "e-612" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Note that \n\n$$\n\\mathbf F(t)=\\int \\mathbf F'(t)\\, \\textrm d t=\\int \\left\\langle 6t^5+2t,\\, \\sec^2 t\\right\\rangle \\, \\textrm d t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨6{t}^{5}+2t,\\,{sec}^{2}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int (6{t}^{5}+2t)\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int {sec}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{6}+{t}^{2}+{c}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{tan}⁡t+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{6}+{t}^{2},\\,\\operatorname{tan}⁡t⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{6}+{t}^{2},\\,\\operatorname{tan}⁡t⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $\\mathbf C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/example-612.json" "file_sha256" "756a84fac8544de6073a5e0a69586616380f4c7c2b860b805325d67032294e30"} {"question" "e-613" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\displaystyle \\int \\left\\langle\\cos(2t+1), \\, 4\\right\\rangle \\,\\textrm d t\\,.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/example-613.json" "file_sha256" "f7b9c97f25f78fb43d2267d607cb9a71c12fcfe325eccdf5b3b7502549eca41e"} {"question" "e-613" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t+1),\\,4⟩\\,\\text{d}t=⟨\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t+1)\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int 4\\,\\text{d}t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $x(t) =\\cos(2t+1),$ we calculate its integral using substitution. So, we let $u= 2t +1.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d u}{\\textrm d t} = 2\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\textrm d t = \\dfrac 1 2 \\textrm d u.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t+1)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡u)+{c}_{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t+1)+{c}_{1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $y(t) =4,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int y(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int 4\\text{d}t=4t+{c}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t+1),\\,4⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t+1)+{c}_{1},\\,4t+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t+1),\\,4t⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t+1),\\,4t⟩+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/example-613.json" "file_sha256" "f7b9c97f25f78fb43d2267d607cb9a71c12fcfe325eccdf5b3b7502549eca41e"} {"question" "e-614" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate $\\displaystyle \\int_0^{2} \\left\\langle 2e^{t},\\, 6t^2\\right\\rangle\\, \\textrm d t.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/example-614.json" "file_sha256" "96f51f7f38fe88727c905081baabaadc2f9034c6afa8e8e61fb39805f381196d"} {"question" "e-614" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}⟨2{e}^{t},\\,6{t}^{2}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{0}^{2}2{e}^{t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,{\\int }_{0}^{2}6{t}^{2}\\,\\text{d}t⟩. \\\\  & =⟨2{e}^{t}\\,\\,{|}_{0}^{2},\\,2{t}^{3}\\,\\,{|}_{0}^{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨[2{e}^{2}-2{e}^{0}],\\,[2\\cdot {2}^{3}-0]⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2{e}^{2}-2,\\,16⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/example-614.json" "file_sha256" "96f51f7f38fe88727c905081baabaadc2f9034c6afa8e8e61fb39805f381196d"} {"question" "e-615" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\mathbf F(t)$ given that $\\mathbf F'(t)= \\left\\langle \\sec t \\tan t, \\,  \\sin(2t)\\right\\rangle$ and $\\mathbf F(0)=\\langle 0,\\, 0\\rangle.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/example-615.json" "file_sha256" "d20b293111cbac091c31683dcc52114e4ea9fb8f1336f3e8df1883ee0a406644"} {"question" "e-615" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Note that \n\n$$\n\\mathbf F(t)=\\int \\mathbf F'(t)\\, \\textrm d t=\\int \\left\\langle \\sec t \\tan t,\\,  \\sin(2t)\\right\\rangle \\, \\textrm d t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int \\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t,\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t+{c}_{1},\\,-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t)+{c}_{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe initial condition $\\mathbf F(0)=\\left\\langle 0,\\, 0 \\right\\rangle$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(0)=⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡0+{c}_{1},\\,-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\cdot 0)+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨0,\\,0⟩ \\\\ ⟨1+{c}_{1},\\,-\\frac{1}{2}+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨0,\\,0⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $c_1=-1$ and $c_2=\\dfrac 12.$ Consequently, \n\n$$\n\\mathbf F(t)=\\left\\langle  \\sec t - 1  , \\,  -\\dfrac 1 2\\cos(2t)+ \\dfrac12\\right\\rangle.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14079867/example-615.json" "file_sha256" "d20b293111cbac091c31683dcc52114e4ea9fb8f1336f3e8df1883ee0a406644"}] "usage" {"e-612" [] "q-123437" [] "q-99378" [] "q-50204" [] "q-80463" [] "e-614" [] "q-50201" [] "q-349193" [] "q-99517" [] "e-615" [] "e-613" [] "q-123474" []} "basis" 2825 "retractions" [] "immutable_answers" [17592186095702 17592186095703 17592186095704 17592186095705 17592186095706 17592186095714 17592186095715 17592186095716 17592186095717 17592186095718 17592186297320 17592186297322 17592186297366 17592186297367 17592186297368 17592186297369 17592186297370 17592186332923 17592186332924 17592186332925 17592186332926 17592186332927 17592186332965 17592186332966 17592186332967 17592186332968 1